    "lines": [
      "What is an AI agent?",
      "An agent is a language model that can take actions, not just answer questions.",
      "It reads your goal, decides on a step, and calls a tool, like search or code.",
      "Then it looks at the result, and loops until the goal is met.",
      "Goal, plan, act, observe. That loop is the whole idea."
    ]
  },
